            p 식[[\mathrm{CH_{3}COO^{-}}] = \dfrac{2.500\,\mathrm{mmol}}{50.00\,\mathrm{mL}}=0.0500\,\mathrm{mol/L}]식
            p 식[K_{b} = \dfrac{K_{w}}{K_{a}} = \dfrac{1.0\times10^{-14}}{1.8\times10^{-5}}=5.56\times10^{-10}]식
            p 식[x = \sqrt{K_{b}c} = \sqrt{(5.56\times10^{-10})(0.0500)}=\sqrt{2.78\times10^{-11}}=5.27\times10^{-6}\,\mathrm{mol/L}]식
