            p 식[K_{a} = \dfrac{K_{w}}{K_{b}} = \dfrac{1.0\times10^{-14}}{1.8\times10^{-5}}=5.56\times10^{-10}]식
            p 식[x = \sqrt{(5.56\times10^{-10})(0.100)}=7.46\times10^{-6}\,\mathrm{mol/L}]식
            p 식[\mathrm{pH}=-\log(7.46\times10^{-6})=5.13]식
